<title>UK: Waterschapsbank sets 300 mln guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Waterschapsbank sets 300 mln guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by</p>
<p>lead manager Rabobank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   WATERSCHAPSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN DFL   COUPON     5.75	MATURITY    30.MAY.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.035   PAY DATE    30.MAY.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.36     SPREAD	+17 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 5-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     MGT/UND    0.325     SELL CONC   1.675</p>
<p> UNDERLYING GOVT BOND FEB 2007 DSL</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
